cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite the accompanying paper (preferred-citation below)
  and the datasets listed in docs/DATASETS.md.
type: software
title: "Cross-Testbed Transfer of Source-Calibrated Intrusion Detection: Threshold Failure and Alert-Budget Constraints"
abstract: >-
  Research code, frozen experimental configurations, evaluation scripts and aggregate results for a study of
  source-calibrated flow-based intrusion detection (CIC-IDS2017, corrected) transferred unchanged to two corrected
  CSE-CIC-IDS2018 days: threshold failure under cross-testbed shift, hourly alert budgets and annotation-budget
  estimation. No datasets are redistributed.
